categoria (VARCHAR(100))&lt;br&gt;
nivel (INT)" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="350" width="300" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bridge" value="&lt;b&gt;BRIDGE_EVENTO_CAMEO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;b&gt;PK/FK&lt;/b&gt; evento_key&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;PK/FK&lt;/b&gt; cameo_key&lt;br&gt;
